title Flexibility Forecasting AI Business Process

Camunda->Kong: Request Flexibility Forecast
Kong->Forecasting Service: Forward Request
activate Forecasting Service

Forecasting Service->Flexibility Event Service: Get past Flexibility Events
activate Flexibility Event Service
Flexibility Event Service->Database: Query past N hours of events
Database-->Flexibility Event Service: FlexibilityEvents records
Flexibility Event Service-->Forecasting Service: Response (events data)
deactivate Flexibility Event Service

note right of Forecasting Service: Build text summary\nof past flexibility events

Forecasting Service->Ollama: POST /api/generate\n{model:"llama3.2", prompt:"Analyse VPP events...", stream:false}
activate Ollama
Ollama-->Forecasting Service: LLM assessment
deactivate Ollama

note right of Forecasting Service: No Kafka output —\nforecast is returned via REST only

Forecasting Service-->Kong: Response (LLM assessment)
deactivate Forecasting Service
Kong-->Camunda: Forward Response (forecast result)
